  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Put 1.5 kg bone-in beef shank (chambarete), cut into thick slices, 4 L water, 1/2 white onion, 1 head garlic, halved, 2 bay leaves, 1 tsp black peppercorns and 1 tbsp salt in a large pot. Bring to a boil, skimming the foam for the first 10 minutes, then simmer gently, partly covered, for 2 hours, until the meat is tender.",
