          "seconds": 480
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve a piece of meat and some of every vegetable in each bowl with plenty of broth. Pass 1/2 white onion, finely chopped, 1/2 bunch cilantro, chopped, 2 serrano chiles, chopped, 3 limes, cut into wedges, 600 g Mexican red rice or white rice and 12 corn tortillas, warmed at the table.",
